{
 "file": "topreward.mdx",
 "units": [
  {
   "id": 0,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 1924,
   "end": 1935,
   "text": "# TOPReward",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 1,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 1937,
   "end": 2235,
   "text": "TOPReward is a **zero-shot reward model** that extracts token log-probabilities from an off-the-shelf vision-language model (VLM) as a robotic reward signal. Given a video trajectory and a task instruction, it returns the VLM's log-likelihood that the instruction is true — no fine-tuning required.",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 2237,
   "end": 2620,
   "text": "**Paper**: [TOPReward: Token Probabilities as Hidden Zero-Shot Rewards for Robotics](⟦0⟧)\n**Project**: [topreward.github.io](⟦1⟧)\n**Original code**: [github.com/TOPReward/TOPReward](⟦2⟧)\n**Default backbone**: [Qwen/Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct](⟦3⟧)",
   "tokens": [
    "https://arxiv.org/abs/2602.19313",
    "https://topreward.github.io/webpage/",
    "https://github.com/TOPReward/TOPReward",
    "https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 2622,
   "end": 2633,
   "text": "## Overview",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 4,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 2635,
   "end": 2786,
   "text": "TOPReward asks a generic VLM how likely a task instruction is, **conditioned on the video** of a robot trying to complete that task. Concretely, given:",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 5,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 2788,
   "end": 2832,
   "text": "- A trajectory video (a sequence of frames).",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 6,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 2833,
   "end": 2881,
   "text": "- A task instruction (e.g. _\"open the drawer\"_).",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 7,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 2883,
   "end": 2918,
   "text": "it builds a chat prompt of the form",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 8,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 3119,
   "end": 3390,
   "text": "forwards it through the VLM, label-masks everything except the very last token, and reads back the log-probability of that token — by default the literal ⟦0⟧ that closes the suffix template. The resulting ⟦1⟧ is the reward.",
   "tokens": [
    "`\"True\"`",
    "`log P(\"True\" | video + prompt + instruction)`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 9,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 3392,
   "end": 3729,
   "text": "Because the method only depends on a frozen VLM, TOPReward is **zero-shot**: there are no fine-tuned weights to host. The \"model\" in LeRobot is a small wrapper around ⟦0⟧' ⟦1⟧ plus the label-masking logic. The processor owns the tokeniser and builds the full chat prompt (EO-1/Robometer pattern).",
   "tokens": [
    "`transformers`",
    "`Qwen3VLForConditionalGeneration`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 10,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 3731,
   "end": 3769,
   "text": "## What the LeRobot integration covers",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 11,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 3771,
   "end": 3842,
   "text": "- Standard ⟦0⟧ configuration through LeRobot.",
   "tokens": [
    "`reward_model.type=topreward`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 12,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 3843,
   "end": 3918,
   "text": "- VLM loading via the ⟦0⟧ ⟦1⟧ API.",
   "tokens": [
    "`transformers`",
    "`Qwen3VLForConditionalGeneration`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 13,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 3919,
   "end": 4029,
   "text": "- Prompt assembly + tokenisation in the processor (matching upstream ⟦0⟧).",
   "tokens": [
    "`QwenClient.compute_instruction_reward`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 14,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 4030,
   "end": 4090,
   "text": "- ⟦0⟧ returns one scalar log-prob per sample.",
   "tokens": [
    "`compute_reward()`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 15,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 4091,
   "end": 4208,
   "text": "- LeRobot reward-model save/load — ⟦0⟧ writes only ⟦1⟧ (the VLM is identified by ⟦2⟧).",
   "tokens": [
    "`save_pretrained`",
    "`config.json`",
    "`vlm_name`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 16,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 4209,
   "end": 4328,
   "text": "- An offline labeling script that writes a ⟦0⟧ (SARM-compatible schema) for RA-BC and overlay.",
   "tokens": [
    "`topreward_progress.parquet`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 17,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 4330,
   "end": 4481,
   "text": "The current LeRobot port supports the **Qwen3-VL client only**. Other upstream clients (Gemini, OpenAI, Gemma, Molmo) can be added as follow-up extras.",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 18,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 4483,
   "end": 4511,
   "text": "## Installation Requirements",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 19,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 4513,
   "end": 4583,
   "text": "1. Install LeRobot following the [Installation Guide](⟦0⟧).",
   "tokens": [
    "./installation"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 20,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 4584,
   "end": 4624,
   "text": "2. Install the TOPReward optional extra:",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 21,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 4669,
   "end": 4706,
   "text": "or, with ⟦0⟧ from a source checkout:",
   "tokens": [
    "`uv`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 22,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 4747,
   "end": 4937,
   "text": "This pulls in ⟦0⟧. The first time you run TOPReward, Hugging Face will also download the VLM weights from the Hub (~16 GB for Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct). A GPU is strongly recommended.",
   "tokens": [
    "`transformers`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 23,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 4939,
   "end": 4966,
   "text": "## Model Inputs and Outputs",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 24,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 4968,
   "end": 4986,
   "text": "TOPReward expects:",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 25,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 4988,
   "end": 5031,
   "text": "- A trajectory video or sequence of frames.",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 26,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 5032,
   "end": 5070,
   "text": "- A natural-language task description.",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 27,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 5072,
   "end": 5115,
   "text": "In LeRobot datasets the preprocessor reads:",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 28,
   "kind": "table",
   "start": 5117,
   "end": 5224,
   "text": "| Config field              | Default                     | Meaning                                       |",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 29,
   "kind": "table",
   "start": 5333,
   "end": 5440,
   "text": "| ⟦0⟧  | ⟦1⟧    | Camera observation used by TOPReward          |",
   "tokens": [
    "`reward_model.image_key`",
    "`observation.images.top`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 30,
   "kind": "table",
   "start": 5441,
   "end": 5548,
   "text": "| ⟦0⟧   | ⟦1⟧                      | Key in complementary data for the task string |",
   "tokens": [
    "`reward_model.task_key`",
    "`task`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 31,
   "kind": "table",
   "start": 5549,
   "end": 5656,
   "text": "| ⟦0⟧ | ⟦1⟧                        | Cap on frames per sample                      |",
   "tokens": [
    "`reward_model.max_frames`",
    "`16`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 32,
   "kind": "table",
   "start": 5657,
   "end": 5764,
   "text": "| ⟦0⟧        | ⟦1⟧                       | Metadata passed to the Qwen video processor   |",
   "tokens": [
    "`reward_model.fps`",
    "`2.0`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 33,
   "kind": "table",
   "start": 5765,
   "end": 5872,
   "text": "| ⟦0⟧   | ⟦1⟧ | Hugging Face Hub id of the underlying VLM     |",
   "tokens": [
    "`reward_model.vlm_name`",
    "`Qwen/Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 34,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 5874,
   "end": 5892,
   "text": "The model returns:",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 35,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 5894,
   "end": 6072,
   "text": "- ⟦0⟧: one log-probability per sample. Higher = better task-video alignment. When ⟦1⟧ is finite, returns the binary thresholded value instead.",
   "tokens": [
    "`compute_reward(batch)`",
    "`success_threshold`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 36,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 6074,
   "end": 6082,
   "text": "## Usage",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 37,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 6084,
   "end": 6118,
   "text": "### Load the reward model directly",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 38,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 6327,
   "end": 6353,
   "text": "### Use the reward factory",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 39,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 6733,
   "end": 6991,
   "text": "The preprocessor tokenises the full prompt (video + prefix + instruction suffix), writes Qwen-VL tensors + ⟦0⟧ under ⟦1⟧. The model reads those tensors, label-masks based on ⟦2⟧, and extracts the log-prob reward.",
   "tokens": [
    "`prompt_length`",
    "`observation.topreward.*`",
    "`prompt_length`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 40,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 6993,
   "end": 7021,
   "text": "### Offline dataset labeling",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 41,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 7023,
   "end": 7098,
   "text": "Write a ⟦0⟧ for RA-BC training and overlay videos:",
   "tokens": [
    "`topreward_progress.parquet`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 42,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 7326,
   "end": 7375,
   "text": "Then render the progress overlay for any episode:",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 43,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 7559,
   "end": 7581,
   "text": "## Configuration Notes",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 44,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 7583,
   "end": 7599,
   "text": "### Prompt knobs",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 45,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 7601,
   "end": 7647,
   "text": "The default prompt mirrors the upstream paper:",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 46,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 7882,
   "end": 7987,
   "text": "Both are exposed on ⟦0⟧ for ablation. The suffix template **must** contain ⟦1⟧.",
   "tokens": [
    "`TOPRewardConfig`",
    "`{instruction}`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 47,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 7989,
   "end": 8006,
   "text": "### Chat template",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 48,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 8008,
   "end": 8202,
   "text": "⟦0⟧ wraps the full prompt (including instruction) with the tokenizer's chat template before tokenisation. Default is ⟦1⟧, matching the upstream paper's main experiments.",
   "tokens": [
    "`add_chat_template=True`",
    "`False`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 49,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 8204,
   "end": 8218,
   "text": "## Limitations",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 50,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 8220,
   "end": 8349,
   "text": "- The current LeRobot port is **inference-only and zero-shot**; ⟦0⟧ is not overridden and ⟦1⟧ returns ⟦2⟧.",
   "tokens": [
    "`forward()`",
    "`is_trainable`",
    "`False`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 51,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 8350,
   "end": 8435,
   "text": "- Only the **Qwen3-VL family** is supported; other upstream clients are out of scope.",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 52,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 8436,
   "end": 8485,
   "text": "- TOPReward inherits the underlying VLM's biases.",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 53,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 8487,
   "end": 8500,
   "text": "## References",
   "tokens": []
  },
